   147	In summary, our paper makes the following contributions:
   148	
   149	
   150	(1) We formulated the bug report reproduction process as a Markov model by simulating all
   151	possible matches between the steps and UI events.
   152	(2) We designed a dynamic programming based algorithm to globally search for the most likely
   153	UI events to reproduce the steps.
   154	(3) Based on the above two contributions, we developed a novel reproduction technique and
   155	implemented it into a research prototype.
   156	(4) We conducted an empirical evaluation to assess the performance of our approach.
   157	(5) Our implementation and evaluation dataset are available for future research [11].
